<title>FRANCE: Renault unions call one-hour strike.</title>
<headline>Renault unions call one-hour strike.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Labour unions at carmaker Renault SA said in a statement after a meeting on Monday that they were calling for a one-hour stoppage at all Renault plants in France, Belgium and Spain.</p>
<p>They said this was in reaction to the announced closure of the Vilvoorde plant near Brussels and expected job losses in France.</p>
</text>
